      { q: "How does B differ from A?", qjp: "Bは Aと どこが ちがいますか。", answer: "B wants some days at the office, while A urges wider adoption.", options: ["B opposes all companies.","B thinks family time is worthless.","B wants some days at the office, while A urges wider adoption.","B wants longer commutes."] }
