      { s: "B", jp: "{旅行|りょこう}{先|さき}や{通勤|つうきん}{電車|でんしゃ}で{何冊|なんさつ}も{持|も}ち{歩|ある}かずに{済|す}むのは、{大|おお}きな{利点|りてん}だ。", ro: "Ryokō saki ya tsūkin densha de nansatsu mo mochi arukazu ni sumu no wa, ōkina riten da.", en: "Not having to carry several books while travelling or commuting is a big advantage." }
