      { s: "", jp: "{実際|じっさい}、{涼|すず}しい{部屋|へや}よりあつい{部屋|へや}の{方|ほう}があくびの{回数|かいすう}が{多|おお}かったという{実験|じっけん}もある。", ro: "Jissai, suzushii heya yori atsui heya no hō ga akubi no kaisū ga ōkatta toiu jikken mo aru.", en: "In fact, there was an experiment in which yawns were more frequent in a hot room than in a cool one." },
      { s: "", jp: "ただし、だれかのあくびがうつる{理由|りゆう}は、まだよく{分|わ}かっていない。", ro: "Tadashi, dareka no akubi ga utsuru riyū wa, mada yoku wakatte inai.", en: "However, why someone else's yawn is catching is still not well understood." }
