      { q: "What does the writer see as the diary's charm?", qjp: "この にっきの みりょくは ひっしゃに よると なんですか。", answer: "Seeing the flow of time by continuing a little each day", options: ["Writing long essays","Seeing the flow of time by continuing a little each day","Saving money","Getting famous"] }
